; Stage 1 of 1941: the river mouth, the sandbars, the flak row, the crossing,
; the approach, then the Flying Fortress.
;
; Carrier mix follows the Powerups contract (powerups-and-drops.md F2): four
; SMALL, two MEDIUM, two LARGE per stage. The first carrier of wave 1 has a
; POD override (Rule 7a), so a new player holds a drone within ten seconds
; and can SEE what a pod is before the table starts rolling. The fourth
; carrier destroyed drops the stage 1-up (Rule 11).
;
; Wave lengths: min_ticks is the pacing floor, max_ticks the ceiling that
; stops one survivor holding a wave open. Both are tighter than the first
; draft, which could take 67 seconds to reach the boss.
